# ============================================================
# QuickDesk Frontend Configuration Template
# ============================================================

# Backend API & WebSocket Origin
# By default, QuickDesk serves the built frontend from the same FastAPI
# origin on port 9000 (window.location.origin).
# 
# Only uncomment and set this if you are running the React development server
# separately on port 3000 (via `npm start`):
# REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:9000
